      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Physical Mutation</strong></p><p>Your feet gain an apelike quality. They are becoming quite dextrous and able to nimbly grip and manipulate objects. You may perform any action with your feet as you would be able to with your hands (assuming you are not currently standing on your feet). You may add your Agility Bonus to any Climb Test, but can only wear custom footwear and reduce your Movement with -1. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
